## The lab: the page itself
lab_eyebrow = Interactive lab
lab_intro = Explore how the mathematical rules change the shape and paths of a floor. Change a value to generate a new map.
lab_loading = Loading the generator…
lab_needs_js = The lab runs the generator in your browser, with WebAssembly, so it needs JavaScript.
lab_levels_title = Choose a level
lab_levels_help = Each level is a starting set of parameters. You can edit any value afterwards.
lab_level_button = Level { $n }
lab_level_aria = Use the level { $n } configuration
lab_level_1 = Introduction: rectangular rooms and few extra connections.
lab_level_2 = Adds L-shaped rooms and the first junctions.
lab_level_3 = Enlarges the map and unlocks diagonal paths and circular rooms.
lab_level_4 = Combines more shapes, junctions and stairs doors.
lab_level_5 = Richest setup: more rooms, shapes and connection alternatives.
lab_seed = Map seed
lab_seed_help = The same seed and parameters generate the same map. Change the seed to explore another random configuration.
lab_seed_aria = Random seed
lab_seed_prev = Previous seed
lab_seed_next = Next seed
lab_seed_random = Random seed
lab_seed_error = The seed must be an integer between 0 and 4,294,967,295.
lab_copy = Copy parameters (JSON)
lab_copied = Parameters copied as JSON.
lab_no_clipboard = The clipboard is not available in this browser.
lab_reset_level = Reset to level default
lab_changed_none = Default configuration
lab_changed_some = { $n } parameter(s) changed
lab_howto_title = How to explore this map
lab_howto_text = Drag the map to move it. Use the mouse wheel or the zoom buttons. Hover a room, junction or corridor to see details. Keys: 1 to 5 pick a level, R a random seed, the arrows the previous or next seed.
lab_overlays_title = What to show
lab_overlays_help = Layers help you understand how the generator built the map. Turn them on one at a time to compare without hiding the rooms.
lab_overlay_cells = Grid
lab_overlay_cells_help = Shows the borders of the cells that make up the floor grid.
lab_overlay_labels = Room names
lab_overlay_labels_help = Shows the number, shape and role of each room.
lab_overlay_ports = Possible doors
lab_overlay_ports_help = Shows every possible door position, including the ones that were not used.
lab_overlay_pairs = Pairs considered
lab_overlay_pairs_help = Shows the pairs of rooms that entered the connection search.
lab_overlay_candidates = Candidate paths
lab_overlay_candidates_help = Shows the candidate paths available to the generator.
lab_experiments_title = Guided experiments
lab_experiments_intro = Apply a sample change to see its effect. It only replaces the parameters involved; you can edit the rest afterwards.
lab_exp_shapes = Mix shapes
lab_exp_shapes_detail = Sets equal weights for the shapes and enables the octilinear alphabet.
lab_exp_shapes_done = Experiment applied: varied shapes and diagonal directions.
lab_exp_cycles = Create more routes
lab_exp_cycles_detail = Raises the target density to favor cycles and shortcuts.
lab_exp_cycles_done = Experiment applied: high cycle density.
lab_exp_junctions = Show T/X junctions
lab_exp_junctions_detail = Raises the weights of three- and four-arm junctions.
lab_exp_junctions_done = Experiment applied: T and X junctions favored.
lab_exp_rooms = Use circular rooms
lab_exp_rooms_detail = Makes circular rooms dominate the draw.
lab_exp_rooms_done = Experiment applied: preference for circular rooms.
lab_params_title = Parameters
lab_params_help = Changes are applied to the map automatically. Each field has an explanation and recommended limits.
lab_group_reset = Reset this group
lab_junction_title = Junction conductance
lab_junction_badge = info
lab_junction_text = The conductance of a junction is a parameter of the reference model that the generator does not use yet, so it is shown but cannot be edited.
lab_junction_current = Current value
lab_junction_inf = ∞ (arms joined)
lab_perf_title = Performance
lab_perf_intro = Benchmarks use the level default configuration, not the values changed in the form.
lab_perf_idle = Benchmarks use the default parameters of the selected level.
lab_perf_40 = Measure 40 maps
lab_perf_800 = Measure batch of 800
lab_perf_40_result = Average: { $ms } ms per map · { $invalid } invalid of 40.
lab_perf_800_run = Measuring the batch…
lab_perf_800_result = 800 maps: 1 worker { $one } ms · { $workers } workers { $many } ms · { $invalid } invalid.
lab_perf_800_fail = Could not measure the batch: { $error }
lab_map_view = Map view
lab_map_label = Floor map. Use the mouse to explore the rooms and corridors.
lab_map_instructions = Drag to move · wheel to zoom · hover elements for details
lab_zoom_out = Zoom out
lab_zoom_in = Zoom in
lab_fit = Fit map
lab_controls_aria = Generator controls
lab_toolbar_aria = Map controls
lab_results_aria = Floor validation and measures

